tmp_text "the map of the maze needs updating.**the bodyguards must follow again, also they should be (able to become)somewhat more tough, they are near to useless now. they could also bemade smarter than they are.**There is some kind of error in the secret instructions of the secret policecaptain. It would also be nice if he gave loer level players at least a chance to solve the quest. The chaosblade must only be accepted from the onewho actually killed the chaosdemon.**The livings on the walking castle's bridge must not be able to run away.I'll make the impression to players that there's a spell on the room thatnullifies all fearing spells. I suggest on implementing this via a shadowon run_away() that is cloned and set to shadow this_player() in the init()of the room. The exit() will remove the shadow, and the shadow will be codedthat it autodestructs if the run_away is called and the evironment ofthe shadowed player is not the walking castle bridge.If there are no objections, i'd make the text of it something like:Padrone has, with the help of the wise jedi Nokey, who understands thenature of fear, put a spell on this room that eliminates all feelingsof fear, You cannot fear anyone out of this room.**Is the weather used at all? If you wanna see weather, i'll show you somereal good looking weather. Like what i build on callandor.**The dungeon that is cloned at the bottom of padrone's static castle has tobe made so that it won't clone an additional monster at a reset when thereare already a certain number of them. I say no more than 10**Instead of having the chaosdemon carry the chaosblade, it can carry a notesaying where it's hidden. This can be at a number of random places.**Spread the 'wanted' posters around some more (i.e.: room/church)Create some more monsters that will make you a desperado**The surgeon in Padrones is not perfect, after trans-x operation the FINGER command still shows the original sexe.I think it was different a while ago, but then again I'm only a shabby little Salesman.**The hat does not have to be worn to be invis!**the stone with the strange weight is bugged.**It is true that the finger command still shows the sex before the operation.This is due to the fact that the player does not get saved rightafter it. I fixed it, tho the file's not been strict_typed yet.Just added some   client->save_me(1);  after the lines set_male() orset_female() etc.**I'd like to make all people in the conference room snoop-proofas well, but i'm not sure how to solve that. Snooping by a NPC does not seemto be the answer to it. Also the help on snoop is a bit sketchy.**i just thought you needed a more updated note hereso here it is=P--------------->ME**Here's another... scrub Padrone!****"
